                        "entry_id": "d7561b61-4d95-3f5b-8d34-8fadcb6d0eaf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An aromatic hydrocarbon of formula C₆H₆ whose structure consists of a ring of alternate single and double bonds."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e7f546d-7855-44a6-b1cc-a6e86e35d39f",
                                "sense_id": "3ec5a557-c300-31a8-817b-fe761eb2c227",
                                "text": "Furthermore, this increase in risk is comparable to the risk of death from leukemia after long-term exposure to benzene, another solvent, which has the well-known property of causing this type of cancer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9348b81e-20e8-4cf6-bd4f-3a24c518669b",
                                "sense_id": "3ec5a557-c300-31a8-817b-fe761eb2c227",
                                "text": "The recall notice, published earlier this week, noted that the affected products likely will not expose people to levels of benzene high enough to cause health issues."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
